<title>USA: AMBAC qualifies seven bond issues for insurance.</title>
<headline>AMBAC qualifies seven bond issues for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMBAC Indemnity Corp said Tuesday it qualified seven bond issues for insurance slated for competitive sale today.</p>
<p>--Regional School District #19, Conn., $5 million GO bonds.  </p>
<p>--East Bridgewater, Mass., $14 million GO bonds.</p>
<p>--Fayettevile, N.C., $16.5 million GO bonds.</p>
<p>--Campbell-Savona Central School District, N.Y., $3.4 million of GO bonds.</p>
<p>--Cato-Meridian CSD, N.Y., $6.5 million of school district bonds.</p>
<p>--Westhill CSD, N.Y., $4.2 million GO school bonds.</p>
<p>--Franklin County, Tenn., $14 million school bonds.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
